Modification of the hw3 ticketing system program:\
	1. In the main function, it will get the environmental variables of the pod that runs the application. The variables are specified in the yaml file for the pod. If the yaml file has NODE_TYPE variable being \'93Client\'94 it will make a Client actor in that pod, else if the NODE_TYPE is \'93Backend_node\'94 it will make a Node actor(which is basically the ticketing system backend).  In the main function, we wait for some time before making of a Node but we do not wait before making a Client actor. This is intended to let clients get notified that pods with Node type actor are up in the actor system. \
\pard\pardeftab720\sl280\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \ulc4 	2. Added a receive case for the client actors:  when the client actor get notified that a member is up on the cluster, it will check whether the new container is running an actor named as its corresponding backend. (Figure 2)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl280\partightenfactor0
\cf4 \ulc4            3. Other standard modification, such as specify that the newly created actors join the seed nodes. And all the original actor classes has the new attribute the the actor system. \
